SUMMARY:Reiki Training + Certification w/Dana Valley
DESCRIPTION:Small Group Experience! Register Today \nOctober 24th\, 10AM – 5PM \nDiscover the foundations of Reiki in the peaceful\, supportive environment of Energy Wave Center®. \nIn this experiential training\, you will be introduced to the history and principles of Usui Reiki and receive your Level I attunement\, opening you to the flow of Reiki energy for self-healing and for supporting others through hands-on practice. \nUsui Reiki Master Teacher Dana Valley\, will be your personal connection with the Reiki tradition. \nTogether explore: \n• The history and lineage of Usui Reiki\n• The Reiki principles as a foundation for daily living\n• Energy awareness\, grounding\, and self-care practices\n• Reiki hand positions for self-treatment and treating others\n• Working with Reiki for family\, friends\, children\, animals\, and plants \nYou will have time to practice\, ask questions\, and become comfortable working with Reiki for yourself and those close to you. \nNo previous Reiki or energy-work experience is needed. Come with curiosity and a willingness to receive. \nStudents will receive a Reiki Level I attunement\, training materials\, and a certificate of completion. \nThis class is open to anyone who feels called to explore Reiki as a path of healing\, personal growth\, and service. \nPlease contact Dana Valley directly with questions: \ndvalley77@gmail.com
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/reiki-training-dana-valley/
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center\, 120 PLeasant Hill Ave. N\, Suite 330\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens,Adults only, 21 and older,Adults, generally,Education,Health,Participatory,Spiritual
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Reiki-Level-1-w-Dana-Valley.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Energy Wave Center":MAILTO:connect@energywavecenter.com
END:VEVENT
