SUMMARY:Growing Great Garlic Class
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we explore the world of garlic in our annual \nand very popular class! \nGarlic has been grown for thousands of years with a rich history. \nGarlic is grouped into two basic types\, soft neck and hard neck. There are also a number of garlic families such as turban\, porcelain \, artichoke types with their unique characteristics and hundreds of varieties from around the world within these families!! \nIn this class we’ll explore this diverse world of garlic and discuss how to grow healthy garlic over it’s 9-month grow season in Sonoma county. \nFree class. Donations appreciated.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/growing-great-garlic-class/
LOCATION:St Stephen’s Episcopal Church\, 500 Robinson Rd\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/CoSeedExchange_logo_text_color-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
