SUMMARY:Lobster Bash by the Rotary Club of Sebastopol
DESCRIPTION:The event includes live boiled lobster (one per person) and tables full of steamed shrimp\, sausage\, corn on the cob and potatoes. The live and silent auctions will feature collector’s wine lots\, getaway trips\, Wine Country experiences\, guest chef affairs and more. There will be live music\, an open bar\, hors oeuvres hour and a raffle.
