SUMMARY:Dr Maria Michael\, Lakota/Diné Traditional Elder visits
DESCRIPTION:Afternoon with Dr Maria Michael – Register Today to join us\nJoin us for an immersive experience where ancient wisdom meets modern science\, shares her unique expertise on how to “restore balance\, maximize your potential\, and fulfill your birthright.” \n\n\nWith a profound understanding of cellular healing philosophies and innate gift to “see through bodies\, time\, and space\,” Dr Michael offers a transformative approach to wellness that transcends traditional therapies. \n\n\n\n\nWhat is included in this event?\n\n\n\n\n•During the first hour Dr Maria will speak to how to align with the frequencies of the world to affect positive change.\n\n•The second hour will include a Q&A and guests will leave with the gift of a breathwork ceremony to practice at home.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nABOUT DR MARIA MICHAEL\n\nMy name is Dr Maria Michael. We graduated with 5 degrees\nall suma cum laude\, and am a Neuropsychologist u and Clinical Psychologist.<br> We are an Indigenous Traditional Spiritual Leader and Elder and use Ancient Wisdom techniques as a healer to help people uncover the imbalances in their bodies\, Spirit\, heart and minds.<br> Most people have swallowed many of their traumas\, and many are also reacting and swallowing the chaos of our current world. \nWe work individually with people of all traditions\, and have done healings with Traditional Elders that are Buddhist\, Hindu\, Nepalese and several from the Amazon in person. We have worked with people as far as Dubai\, Australia\, New Zealand an Africa\, as well in the United States.\n<br>\nWe have consulted at Sloan Kettering\, John Hopkins\, MD Anderson\, and the Keith Block Center for Integrative Medicine. We used to have ER privileges with a medical doctor we worked with in Boulder\, CO. \nWe are in the process of building a sweat lodge in Marshall.<br> \nWe are All related to all Living Being and we all come from One Creation\, in its purest form. ( see our website: www.drmariamichael.com)
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/dr-maria-michael/
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center\, 120 PLeasant Hill Ave. N\, Suite 330\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens,Adults only, 21 and older,Adults, generally,Education,Health,Older adults generally, 60+,Skill-Building Workshop,Spiritual
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Dr-Maria-SEBTIMES-PROMO-900x425-SIZE.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Energy Wave Center":MAILTO:connect@energywavecenter.com
END:VEVENT
