SUMMARY:IPA10K + Brewfest + Beer Mile & Hallowine Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Two fabulous events in one! Coming Halloween weekend to The Barlow!\nGet ready for the ultimate celebration of beer\, wine\, and running! Two fan favorite events — the IPA10K + Brewfest + Beer Mile and the Hallowine Half Marathon — are combined into one for an unforgettable day of fitness\, fun\, and festivities. This running extravaganza happens on Saturday\, November 1st at The Barlow in Sebastopol. Whether you are chasing a PR or just looking for a good time\, this event has something for everyone. Run the iconic IPA10K\, tackle the Hallowine Half Marathon\, jog the 3K\, or rally your best beer drinking buddy to compete in the 2-person Beer Mile. And our Wagging Tail Run invites you to bring your dog for a tail-wagging good time in the 3k or 10k. Once you have crossed the finish line\, celebrate your victory at our Brewfest and Wine Festival\, featuring local breweries and wineries\, live bands\, delicious food trucks\, and an entertaining Halloween costume contest. Watch the pros compete for prize money and the breweries compete for bragging rights in the Beer Mile competition The Barlow is a vibrant hub of shops\, restaurants\, and tasting rooms—perfect for making a day of it with friends\, family\, and fellow running enthusiasts. Come for the race\, stay for the festival\, and enjoy the perfect blend of spirits\, sweat\, and spooks at Sebastopol’s most anticipated event of the season! Register now for the race and get ready to run\, sip\, and celebrate!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/ipa10k-brewfest-beer-mile-hallowine-half-marathon/2026-11-01/
LOCATION:The Barlow\, 6770 McKinley St\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults, generally,Entertainment/Culture,Exercise/Yoga
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IPA10K-Logo.png
ORGANIZER;CN="A Good Run":MAILTO:matt@agoodrun.org
GEO:38.403775;-122.821626
