DESCRIPTION:Dionysian Revel and Book Release Celebration!\nFriday\, November 6th at 7pm\nSubud Hall\n​234 Hutchins Ave Sebastopol\n$10 at the door \nJoin us in celebrating the release of Phoenix’s newest book\, Dionysus with a Dionysian Revel! Come and make merry with the wild girl faced god. Sing\, drink\, dance\, and allow your inner maenad to enjoy in ecstasy. This is a 21+ event\, wine will be served.\nIo Evohe Dionysus!
